(keepemptylines)=

**KeepEmptyLines** (`KeepEmptyLinesStyle`) {versionbadge}`clang-format 19` {ref}`¶ <KeepEmptyLines>`

: Which empty lines are kept.  See `MaxEmptyLinesToKeep` for how many
